    "text": "Match List I with List II :<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>List-I<br />\t\t\tElements</td>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>List-II Properties</p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(a)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Li</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(i)</td>\t\t\t<td>Poor water solubility of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>-</mo></msup></math>salt</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(b)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Na</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(ii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Most abundant element in cell fluid</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(c)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iii)</td>\t\t\t<td>Bicarbonate salt used in fire extinguisher</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(d)</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Cs</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)</td>\t\t\t<td>Carbonate salt decomposes easily on heating</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given<br />below:</p>",
